Subject: Large segment size in DSM limit the spatial resolution of density covariates
Message-ID: <WN0sJdlCKWI.gHOSp0O0AQAJ@distance-sampling.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/distance-sampling/c/WN0sJdlCKWI/m/gHOSp0O0AQAJ>
